  "unemployment_basis": "Three unemployment measures are carried and each is labelled in the field the reader sees: (1) the ILO modelled estimate, a modelled figure produced by the ILO for cross-country comparability; (2) the national estimate, the national source's own figure as ILOSTAT compiles it, whose underlying definition differs by country; and (3) the national statistics office's own release, quoted verbatim from the document named. These are different measures and are not interchangeable.",
